{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:12.516420+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for the bug report, I will look into this. It does cross my mind that perhaps the bug is elsewhere, i.e., the function runs  on GPU even though the data is on the CPU.\r\n\r\nOne thing I would do is to make the print_device return `x` and then inspect the returned value to see on what device it lives. Try `data._device` or `data.device_buffer`.","created_at":"2022-03-31T12:36:35Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082#issuecomment-1084524058","id":1084524058,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5ApIYa","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1084524058/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-03-31T12:36:35Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1084524058","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890983?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnecula","id":3890983,"login":"gnecula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTA5ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for your response. It looks like `jax.jit` is executing on the correct device:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nimport jax.experimental.host_callback as hcb\r\n\r\ndef _print_device(_, device):\r\n    print(device)\r\n\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef print_device(x):\r\n    hcb.call(_print_device, x, call_with_device=True)\r\n    return x\r\n\r\ncpu = jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]\r\ngpu = jax.devices(\"gpu\")[0]\r\na = jax.device_put(jnp.array(1), cpu)\r\nb = jax.device_put(jnp.array(1), gpu)\r\nc = print_device(a).block_until_ready()\r\nd = print_device(b).block_until_ready()\r\nprint(c.device())\r\nprint(d.device())\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ngpu:0\r\ngpu:0\r\nTFRT_CPU_0\r\ngpu:0\r\n```","created_at":"2022-03-31T12:41:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082#issuecomment-1084528888","id":1084528888,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5ApJj4","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1084528888/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-03-31T12:42:23Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1084528888","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33688385?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/patrick-kidger","id":33688385,"login":"patrick-kidger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg4Mzg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/orgs","received