\r\ncpu = jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]\r\ngpu = jax.devices(\"gpu\")[0]\r\na = jax.device_put(jnp.array(1), cpu)\r\nb = jax.device_put(jnp.array(1), gpu)\r\nprint_device(a)\r\nprint_device(b)\r\n```\r\nprints:\r\n```\r\ngpu:0\r\ngpu:0\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected behaviour:\r\n```\r\nTFRT_CPU_0\r\ngpu:0\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis seems to happen with or without the `jax.jit`.","closed_at":"2023-05-14T02:58:12Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33688385?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/patrick-kidger","id":33688385,"login":"patrick-kidger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg4Mzg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrick-kidger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":6,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082/comments","created_at":"2022-03-30T12:43:11Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/10082","id":1186404431,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","